- 亮点草案（研究二后定稿）：
  1. Wave composition under shared freight elevators is formulated as candidate selection with a fixed dispatch rule.
  2. The throughput abstraction of elevator capacity is proven optimistic relative to true co-occupancy, with two reversal mechanisms.
  3. A generate, screen, and verify procedure composes waves in seconds and is verified by event-driven simulation.
  4. Re-ordering orders at release recovers x% of the gain that operational clustering delivers.
  5. Preregistered diagnostics bound where closed-form class rules stop being reliable.
- 关键词：wave release; multi-story warehouse; autonomous mobile robots; freight elevator; model uncertainty; preregistered simulation.

